   "texto": [
    "The adjective is taken in feminine and added **-mente**: **lenta → lentamente**, **chiara → chiaramente**. If the adjective ends in **-e** or **-le**, it is changed to **-mente** without more: **facile → facilmente**.",
    "Example: **Parla lentamente** (speak slowly)."
